Maintainer: Alexander P. Christensen <alexpaulchristensen@gmail.com>
Description: Implements several functions for the analysis of semantic networks including different network estimation algorithms, partial node bootstrapping (Kenett, Anaki, & Faust, 2014 <doi:10.3389/fnhum.2014.00407>), random walk simulation, and a function to compute global network measures. Significance tests, including permutation testing, and plotting features are also implemented.
